<main class="page-container">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-badge">PluralTech LTD Legal</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">
      Effective Date: January 1, 2026. Your privacy and data security are foundational to how we build Type Station.
    </p>
  </section>

  <article class="content-card">
    <h2>1. Introduction & Overview</h2>
    <p>
      Type Station ("we," "our," or "the Service") is developed and operated by <strong>PluralTech LTD</strong>. This Privacy Policy details our practices concerning the collection, usage, storage, and disclosure of information when you interact with our typing training platform, web application, and associated developer tools.
    </p>
    <p>
      By accessing or using Type Station, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to the practices outlined in this policy.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We believe in data minimization. We only collect information essential for delivering and improving your typing speed and syntax practice:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account Credentials:</strong> If you choose to register an account, we collect your username, email address, and a cryptographically hashed representation of your password. We never store plain-text passwords.</li>
      <li><strong>Drill Performance & Keystroke Metrics:</strong> To provide personalized analytics, speed progression, accuracy diagnostics, and weakest-key tracking, we collect session statistics including net words per minute (WPM), raw keystrokes, precision percentages, and character error counts.</li>
      <li><strong>Custom Sandbox Snippets:</strong> Code blocks, custom texts, and snippets saved in your personal sandbox are stored locally on your device or linked to your account when signed in.</li>
      <li><strong>Communication Information:</strong> Inquiries submitted via our contact form or official WhatsApp support channels are retained solely to address your support requests.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>Information gathered by PluralTech LTD is used exclusively to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Deliver real-time typing feedback, visual sparklines, and session results.</li>
      <li>Calculate rolling daily, weekly, and monthly practice duration benchmarks.</li>
      <li>Generate algorithmic coaching insights regarding keystroke accuracy disparities across modes.</li>
      <li>Authenticate user sessions and maintain persistent user preferences across browser sessions.</li>
      <li>Prevent malicious abuse, DDoS attacks, and system tampering.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Local Storage & Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Type Station utilizes modern browser <code>localStorage</code> to store user themes, chosen fonts, audio preference sliders, and cached practice history for immediate offline accessibility. HTTP session cookies are utilized strictly for user authentication state management.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
    <p>
      PluralTech LTD <strong>does not sell, rent, monetize, or trade</strong> your personal information or keystroke metrics to third parties, data brokers, or advertisers. We do not integrate intrusive third-party ad networks or tracking trackers.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Data Security & Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We implement industry-standard encryption protocols (SSL/TLS in transit, salted cryptographic hashing for credentials) to safeguard your account. You have the right to request deletion of your account and associated session records at any time by contacting our support team.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Inquiries & Data Rights</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your data privacy rights, please contact PluralTech LTD at:
    </p>
    <p style="font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-accent);">
      privacy@pluraltech.ltd | support@typestation.dev<br>
      WhatsApp Support: +2349032218901
    </p>
  </article>
